{"version":1,"content":"<p>歌手莫文蔚（Karen）早前重返寧夏銀川壓軸登場《N² 愛尚覽山演唱會2026》，深情演唱多首經典歌《這世界那麼多人》、《忽然之間》等，當演唱會大屏幕上播出《大話西游》中「白晶晶」的片段時，Karen感性表示：「又回到這個夢開始的地方」。</p><p>1</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T07:31:32.892574+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-30T07:01:38+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T07:20:20.114916+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-30T07:20:20.114916+00:00","content_hash":"086e1d18c06592abee046682d60aa001f00d4512cda2ecde13a6b3cf65ff443e","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}